{title: Socha Nahi Tha}
{artist: Shaan Kaante}
{key: B}

{c: Verse 1}
[B]Socha nahi tha,        Taq [A]deer yahan laayegi
[F#m]Manzil pe aate hi,        [B]Jaan chali [Em]jaayegi
O, [B]yeh to Sikandar ne,        [Am]Bhi nahi tha socha
[F#m]Aane se pehle,        Khu [B]shi laut [Em]jaayegi
[B]Humne socha tha kya,        [Am]Aur kya se kya hua
[F#m]Jaa rahe hai aaj yeh,        Za [B]maane ko bataake
[Em]Yeh kya ho gaya rama [F#m]re,        [D]Yeh kya ho gaya maula [Em]re
[Em]Yeh kya ho gaya rama [F#m]re,        [D]Yeh kya ho gaya maula [Em]re
[B]Tera kusoor tha,        Ya [A]mera kusoor tha
[F#m]Tera guroor tha,        Ya [B]mera gu [Em]roor tha
[B]Rabba main itna,        [A]Bura nahi hota
[F#m]Tu agar,        Bewa [B]fa nahi [Em]hota
[B]Itna bata mujhe,        [Am]Kya mila tujhe
[F#m]Gham ke yeh kaante meri,        [B]Raahon mein bichaake
[Em]Yeh kya ho gaya rama [F#m]re,        [D]Yeh kya ho gaya maula [Em]re
[Em]Yeh kya ho gaya rama [F#m]re,        [D]Yeh kya ho gaya maula [Em]re
